# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says: design hashes read file bytes, and a checkout that turned
# them CRLF would send every design back through check.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Apply appends to the ledger and commits it on each session's branch: keep every branch's lines on merge.
prefs/*/decisions.jsonl merge=union
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tga binary
*.mip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.psd binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.rpy binary
